WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Gentle original music] A warm lock screen. A tap opens your morning.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
[Soft message tones] Mira suggests an easy outfit with sage and oat layers.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
The Olive Edit appears: an original 3D clothing collection. [Tap]

00:11.000 --> 00:16.200
Outfit details open with a smooth screen transition.

00:16.200 --> 00:22.500
[Click and selection chimes] A pointer chooses the ink trousers and walnut tote.

00:22.500 --> 00:26.000
[Confirmation chime] Wear today. The edit is ready.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.500
[Message tone] Mira has tomorrow in mind, too.

00:28.500 --> 00:30.000
Morrow Atelier. A little more you. [Music fades]
